* FB5 SiGe HBT models (research PDK): Gummel-Poon fitted to published IBM SiGe 5HP figures (fit_hbt.py).
* Emitter 0.5 x 2.5 um. hp RB=124 ohm = measured Rb@100uA (Bacon, Microwave Journal 2002);
* hb RB=96 ohm is an ESTIMATE (no published Rb for the high-breakdown NPN).
* fT fitted with TF; fMAX is EXTRACTED from Y-parameters (Mason U=1), see fit_hbt.txt / val_fmax.txt.
* BVceo (3.3 V hp / 5.5 V hb) is NOT modelled by Gummel-Poon: keep VCE below it; use the VBIC cards.
.MODEL fb5npn_hp NPN (IS=5e-18 BF=145 NF=1.0 VAF=60 IKF=18m ISE=4e-17 NE=1.6 BR=5 VAR=3 IKR=1m RB=124 IRB=0.4m RBM=25 RE=6 RC=35 CJE=9f VJE=0.9 MJE=0.3 CJC=5f VJC=0.6 MJC=0.3 XCJC=0.5 CJS=8f VJS=0.6 MJS=0.3 TF=2.8p XTF=6 VTF=2.0 ITF=20m TR=50p EG=1.11 XTI=3 XTB=1.5)
.MODEL fb5npn_hb NPN (IS=5e-18 BF=145 NF=1.0 VAF=90 IKF=8m ISE=4e-17 NE=1.6 BR=5 VAR=3 IKR=1m RB=96 IRB=0.4m RBM=19 RE=6 RC=120 CJE=9f VJE=0.9 MJE=0.3 CJC=3.5f VJC=0.6 MJC=0.3 XCJC=0.5 CJS=8f VJS=0.6 MJS=0.3 TF=4.03p XTF=6 VTF=2.0 ITF=8m TR=50p EG=1.11 XTI=3 XTB=1.5)
